entation":{"license":"Apache-2.0","readme":"# Notion\n\nConnect your Agorch agents to Notion through Notion's official MCP server (`https://mcp.notion.com/mcp`). Agents can search your workspace and read pages and databases. This connector is read-only.\n\n## What your agents can do\n\n| Tool | What it does | Changes data |\n|---|---|---|\n| Search Notion | Searches the pages and databases you shared. | No |\n| Read a page or database | Reads the content of a page or the rows of a database. | No |\n\n## What connecting asks for\n\n- **One click and one sign-in.** Agorch already has a Notion app, so there is nothing to create. Click Connect, sign in to Notion and choose the pages the agents may see.\n- The connection belongs to your Agorch organization, and every agent in the organization uses it.\n\n### Permissions\n\n| Scope | In plain words |\n|---|---|\n| `default` | Search and read the pages you share during the connection |\n\nNotion has no finer scopes. What the agents can see is exactly the set of pages you pick on Notion's consent screen, and you can change it later in Notion.\n\n## Examples\n\n- \"Find our refund policy page and summarize it.\"\n- \"Read the Roadmap database and list the items due this month.\"\n\n## Data sent to Notion\n\nSearch queries and page IDs.\n\n## Good to know\n\nOnly the two read tools above are allowed through.\n","release_notes":"Adds the Apache-2.0 license, an English README, English tool names and descriptions, plain-language descriptions of the requested permissions and the source commit this release was built from. Tool behavior, permissions and endpoints are unchanged.","scope_labels":{"default":"Search and read the pages you share during the connection"},"source":{"commit":"cb55c29b5f2178bc631ac3eceefe8e2fbaa88565","path":"connectors/notion","repository":"https://github.com/smartvisioncomputing/agorch-plugins","tree":"78e1edf505e5e3a70091b05f8973442c5441e13e"}},"version":"0.1.3"},"policy_refs":[],"provenance":{"authored_by":"publisher:ao","compiler":{"name":"aicl","version":"1.1.0"},"derived_from":[],"origin":"aicl","sources":[{"revision":"0.1.3","source_kind":"aicl","source_ref":"ao/notion"}],"transformations":[{"name":"aicl.plugin-build","version":"1.1.0"}]},"requirements":{"capabilities":[],"connections":[{"allowed_consumers":[{"component_id":"notion_fetch","kind":"tool"},{"component_id":"notion_search","kind":"tool"}],"capabilities":["http.request"],"credential_type_ref":{"component_id":"connection","kind":"connection_definition"},"permissions":[],"requirement_id":"notion_mcp"}],"model":[],"secrets":[]},"risk":{"side_effects":["read_only"],"tier":"R0"},"runtime_contract":{"name":"ao-portable-runtime","required_features":["tool_calls","integration.multitool_shared_connection.v1"],"version_constraint":">=1.0.0 <2.0.0"},"schema_version":"1.1.0"}